 "headline": "\"The creativity behind it is so cool. It’s such a different world.” - Coi Leray",
 "intro": "<em>DOODLES PARTNERED WITH IHC FOR THE DEBUT OF DULLESVILLE AND THE DOODLEVERSE </em>'S AT TIFF.",
 "introPieces": [
  {
