   ],
   "html": "<p><strong>Doodles</strong>, the NFT brand known for its playful characters and joyful use of colors, sought a creative partner to help premiere their original film to the world at the <strong>Toronto International Film Festival</strong>. </p>\n<p>IHC was enlisted to translate the brand and its ethos into a memorable red carpet debut coupled with a who’s who celebratory party. Months of teasers, original music releases, and production development culminated in an immersive evening with musical stars <strong>Pharrell</strong>, <strong>Coi Leray</strong>, <strong>Trippie Redd,</strong> and more in attendance.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "IMMERSIVE DECOR",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Giant rainbow drips were projected onto the exterior of our venue, <strong>Design Exchange</strong>, creating a striking and colorful arrival moment. Guests walked through a rainbow portal onto the pink carpet. </p>",
     "right": "<p>Inside showcased a fully animated world with floor to ceiling projections across the main walls that evolved throughout the evening. Lush plant arrangements completed the aesthetic.</p>"
    },
