  {
   "title": "party & screening",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Inside, a virtual tour de force on the international club and special event circuit,<strong> DJ Spider</strong> spun live all night long to keep the dance floor grooving. As guests accumulated, we screened two brand new Doodles music videos, followed by CEO Julian Holguin introducing the premiere of <strong><em>Dullsillve and the Doodleverse</em></strong> to the crowd. The moment closed out with another debut of an unreleased Doodles track.</p>"
