   "title": "merch store",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The boutique-style merch store was a custom-built space offering exclusive Doodles products for purchase, including brand collaboration pieces with <strong>G-SHOCK</strong>, <strong>Jibbitz</strong>, <strong>Adidas,</strong> and <strong>Arizona Iced Tea</strong>.</p>"
